{"id":"0ad886c6bc35a838","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-artinian.md","title":"Artinian Ring","display":"df-artinian — Artinian Ring","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-artinian","aliases":["58-df-artinian","Artinian Ring"],"display":"df-artinian — Artinian Ring","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-artinian"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-artinian</span><span>Artinian Ring</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-artinian — Artinian Ring"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-ring.md\">../batch11/58-df-ring.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\)</span>（环，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-ring.md\">../batch11/58-df-ring.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L(R,+,\\cdot,0_R)\\coloneqq\\{I\\subseteq R\\mid 0_R\\in I\\land\\forall x,y\\in I\\;(x+y\\in I)\\land\\forall x\\in I\\;\\exists y\\in I\\;(x+y=0_R)\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall x\\in I\\;(r\\cdot x\\in I)\\}\">\\(\\mathcal L(R,+,\\cdot,0_R)\\coloneqq\\{I\\subseteq R\\mid 0_R\\in I\\land\\forall x,y\\in I\\;(x+y\\in I)\\land\\forall x\\in I\\;\\exists y\\in I\\;(x+y=0_R)\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall x\\in I\\;(r\\cdot x\\in I)\\}\\)</span>（仅用已给定环运算定义的左理想集）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeftArtinian}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{LeftArtinian}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>（本文件定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}artinian} \\vdash \\mathrm{LeftArtinian}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\land\\forall I\\in\\mathcal L(R,+,\\cdot,0_R)^\\omega\\;\\left((\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(I(n+1)\\subseteq I(n)))\\to\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq n\\to I(n)=I(N))\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}artinian} \\vdash \\mathrm{LeftArtinian}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\land\\forall I\\in\\mathcal L(R,+,\\cdot,0_R)^\\omega\\;\\left((\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(I(n+1)\\subseteq I(n)))\\to\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq n\\to I(n)=I(N))\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Left Artinian means the descending-chain condition on left ideals for the designated ring operations.</li>\n<li>加法逆元通过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x+y=0_R\">\\(x+y=0_R\\)</span> 存在量化，而不是调用签名中没有给出的减法运算。</li>\n<li>Hilbert basis theorem: Noetherian <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nRightarrow\">\\(\\nRightarrow\\)</span> Artinian (e.g., <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k[t]\">\\(k[t]\\)</span>)</li>\n<li>对交换 Artinian 环存在有限个 Artinian 局部环的直积分解；非交换情形不能无条件使用该表述。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Atiyah and MacDonald, Introduction to Commutative Algebra</li>\n<li>Lam, A First Course in Noncommutative Rings</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)$（环，see [[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L(R,+,\\cdot,0_R)\\coloneqq\\{I\\subseteq R\\mid 0_R\\in I\\land\\forall x,y\\in I\\;(x+y\\in I)\\land\\forall x\\in I\\;\\exists y\\in I\\;(x+y=0_R)\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall x\\in I\\;(r\\cdot x\\in I)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LeftArtinian}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}artinian} \\vdash \\mathrm{LeftArtinian}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\land\\forall I\\in\\mathcal L(R,+,\\cdot,0_R)^\\omega\\;\\left((\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(I(n+1)\\subseteq I(n)))\\to\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq n\\to I(n)=I(N))\\right)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"x+y=0_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\nRightarrow","display":false},{"tex":"k[t]","display":false}],"bytes":1554,"backlinks":[{"id":"5abc65f95514f629","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ring}_S\\subseteq V^5$ and $\\mathrm{LeftArtinian}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]], [[../batch02/58-df-artinian.md]])."},{"id":"2ef90c1cbce2936f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LeftArtinian}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)$ (left-Artinian predicate, see [[58-df-artinian]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-146","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-artinian.md|58-df-artinian]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["1c30d21ea7b443f6"]}